  "verse": 11,
  "translation": "“All the servants of the king and the people of the provinces of the king know that whoever, man or woman, comes to the king into the inner court, who has not been summoned — one law of his is to put ⟨him⟩ to death, except the one to whom the king extends ⟨את⟩ the golden scepter, and he lives. But I have not been summoned to come to the king ⟨for⟩ these thirty days.”",
